      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In this scene in the restaurant, Chef Viktor Barinov entrusts his lively daughter Alisa to sous-chef Lyova. Alisa quickly takes control of the situation and convinces Lyova to play hide-and-seek. Listen to their amusing dialogue in Russian first, and then we will examine each sentence.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
