      "t": "Может, лучше просто посидим?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я папе скажу, он тебя уволит!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Хорошо, во что будем играть?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Давай в прятки!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "А кто будет прятаться?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Конечно, я буду прятаться!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Тебя такого длинного нигде не спрячешь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Закрывай глаза, считай до ста.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Раз, два, три, четыре...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Считай медленно, я иду прятаться!",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now, let us examine the vocabulary and phrasing of this entertaining exchange sentence by sentence.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Лёва, сиди здесь и смотри за Алисой.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Lyova, sit here and watch over Alisa.' Viktor gives his sous-chef a direct command.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Глаз с нее не спускай.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not take your eyes off her.' Viktor reinforces his strict instruction with a firm tone.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "И не давай шоколад, у нее аллергия.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And do not give her chocolate, she has an allergy.' Viktor warns him about her dietary restriction.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Дядя Лёва, давай играть!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Uncle Lyova, let us play!' Alisa demands his attention with energetic excitement.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Может, лучше просто посидим?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maybe we could just sit here instead?' Lyova suggests a quiet alternative with gentle hesitation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я папе скажу, он тебя уволит!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will tell Dad, he will fire you!' Alisa issues a cheeky threat with complete confidence.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Хорошо, во что будем играть?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, what should we play?' Lyova gives in to her demand with a nervous sigh.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Давай в прятки!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us play hide and seek!' Alisa proposes a classic game with eager delight.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "А кто будет прятаться?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And who will hide?' Lyova asks for clarification about the rules of their game.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Конечно, я буду прятаться!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course, I will hide!' Alisa announces her role with immediate enthusiasm.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Тебя такого длинного нигде не спрячешь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are so tall, you cannot be hidden anywhere.' Alisa points out his imposing height with blunt honesty.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Закрывай глаза, считай до ста.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Close your eyes, count to a hundred.' Alisa sets the countdown before running away.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Раз, два, три, четыре...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'One, two, three, four...' Lyova begins counting out loud with an obedient voice.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Считай медленно, я иду прятаться!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Count slowly, I am going to hide!' Alisa calls out her final rule as she slips away. Now, let us listen to the complete scene once more to consolidate your comprehension.",
      "gap": 0.9
